    {
      "target": "정치인은 대중의 생각을 잘 들어야 해요.",
      "reading": "jeongchineuneun daejungui saenggakeul jal deureoya haeyo.",
      "translations": {
        "en": "A politician should listen carefully to the public’s thoughts.",
